        "description": "Wrap instruction for turning one summarized captured item into active-recall prompts consumed through ask-questions-sort-answers-follow-up question-sequence records.",
        "wrap_prefix": "From this content produce active-recall questions: one multiple-choice prompt with answer choices in the prompt text, one single-choice prompt with answer choices in the prompt text, and one open-ended-synthesis prompt. Return ONLY a JSON array of exactly three objects with a text field. Content: "
